{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:osdk.lock",
    "title": "osdk 锁定工具链与依赖快照",
    "summary": "锁文件固定 Linux x64 的 Node 24.18.1、pnpm 11.28.2 安装器、原生 pnpm 锁摘要和 osdk-guide 的解析提交，用于可复现依赖恢复。它记录解析结果与校验信息，不单独证明下载、安装或项目检查已经成功。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "runtime",
        "title": "运行时与安装输入",
        "body": "锁文件 schema 为 4，并将 Linux x64 的 Node 请求与解析版本都固定为 `24.18.1`，同时记录官方归档地址、文件名和 SHA-256 校验值；该工具配置关闭 corepack。[[c1]] pnpm 依赖解析使用安装器版本 `11.28.2` 和 Node 24.18.1，输入清单为 `package.json`，安装命令带 frozen lockfile，并允许从源码构建。[[c2]] 这些字段共同限定可复现安装输入，但执行成功仍应依据真实命令退出码。"
      },
      {
        "key": "locks",
        "title": "原生锁与技能来源",
        "body": "依赖快照进一步固定 `pnpm-lock.yaml` 的路径和摘要，使 manifest 或原生锁变化能够被检测，而不是静默沿用旧解析结果。[[c3]] `osdk-guide` 技能来自 `github:lejunyang/one-sdk`，解析到明确提交并记录内容哈希，面向 universal 与 claude-code agent。[[c4]] 因而实际上游是 one-sdk；锁文件只描述当前解析快照，不表示远端永久可达，也不代替 `osdk deps --frozen` 与项目检查。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "Node 锁定记录",
        "reason": "支持 Linux x64 Node 版本、归档来源、校验值和 corepack 配置。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:osdk.lock",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "schema = 4\n\n[platforms.linux-x64.tools.node]\nrequest = \"24.18.1\"\nversion = \"24.18.1\"\n\n[platforms.linux-x64.tools.node.options]\narch = \"x64\"\ncorepack = \"false\"\n\n[platforms.linux-x64.tools.node.artifact]\nurl = \"https://nodejs.org/dist/v24.18.1/node-v24.18.1-linux-x64.tar.gz\"\nfile_name = \"node-v24.18.1-linux-x64.tar.gz\"\nc"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "pnpm 安装快照",
        "reason": "支持 pnpm 安装器版本、运行时、manifest、冻结安装命令与源码构建设置。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:osdk.lock",
          "startLine": 16,
          "endLine": 23
        },
        "quote": "[deps.pnpm]\ninstaller = \"pnpm\"\ninstaller_version = \"11.28.2\"\nruntime = \"node@24.18.1\"\nmanifest = \"package.json\"\nmanifest_sha256 = \"92a0e297b8c8efa902f03db922a7b594fc7c3f3ab79402fd85eecfc454c76edd\"\nrun = \"pnpm.cmd install --frozen-lockfile\"\nallow_build_from_source = true"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "pnpm 原生锁摘要",
        "reason": "支持原生锁文件种类、路径和摘要的可复现性约束。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:osdk.lock",
          "startLine": 25,
          "endLine": 28
        },
        "quote": "[deps.pnpm.native_lock]\nkind = \"pnpm-lock\"\npath = \"pnpm-lock.yaml\"\nsha256 = \"573790b7a0e8fa299120cb75805b1cbea161ad5e8abab18824becc35cb1246ae\""
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "osdk-guide 解析结果",
        "reason": "支持技能的真实上游、内容哈希、固定提交和适用 agent。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:osdk.lock",
          "startLine": 30,
          "endLine": 37
        },
        "quote": "[skills.osdk-guide]\nsource = \"github:lejunyang/one-sdk\"\ncontent_hash = \"b3-v2:25feab3235fe25a48293e03508e2dfc0f447c3f6dc178f36748ebf7ba1a390b4\"\nresolved_commit = \"02a2f2b3142ded7d73554aaee629a24966a62313\"\nagents = [\n    \"universal\",\n    \"claude-code\",\n]"
      }
    ],
